<title>USA: University of Kentucky, won by Griffin Kubik.</title>
<headline>University of Kentucky, won by Griffin Kubik.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Griffin Kubik Stephens &amp; Thompson said it won $6.645 million of University of Kentucky, housing and dining system revenue bonds, Series Q, with a net interest cost of 5.47 percent.</p>
